1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:06,024
Shelves empty faster than stock records can keep up.

2
00:00:06,244 --> 00:00:13,612
Counts are done by hand, Odoo is updated late, and low stock is noticed only when it is already gone.

3
00:00:15,662 --> 00:00:19,214
The camera doesn't just detect low stock.

4
00:00:21,664 --> 00:00:25,432
It continuously monitors shelf quantities,

5
00:00:27,852 --> 00:00:31,068
synchronizes inventory with Odoo,

6
00:00:34,888 --> 00:00:38,872
and alerts the team when replenishment is required.

7
00:00:41,872 --> 00:00:44,368
Live shelf counts.

8
00:00:44,588 --> 00:00:47,852
Inventory that is always in sync.

9
00:00:48,072 --> 00:00:52,056
And replenishment, before the shelf runs empty.

10
00:00:56,606 --> 00:00:59,078
SKIT AI Vision.

11
00:00:59,298 --> 00:01:01,866
By Srikesh Infotech.

12
00:01:02,086 --> 00:01:06,382
Every shelf. Always in sync.

